---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us – Background Changer Online Utility"
  description="Learn about Background Changer (onlinebackgroundchange.com), a free, private, client-side photo background editor designed for instant background removal and document preparation."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-3 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900">
        About Our Utility
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Fast, Private Photo Background Editing For Everyone
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Background Changer</strong> (<strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">onlinebackgroundchange.com</strong>) was built with a single goal: provide a fast, lightweight, and completely private <strong>image background changer</strong> for changing backgrounds, cropping portraits, and preparing official application photos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/80 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Utility-First Speed
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          No sign-ups, no subscriptions, no complicated menus, and zero bloated toolbars. You upload an image, <strong>change background color</strong>, and download your final photo in seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          🔒
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          100% Client-Side Privacy
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Your photos are processed directly inside your browser memory. We act as an in-browser <strong>background remover</strong> without ever uploading, storing, or transmitting your portraits to cloud servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/80 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4">
          🎯
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          Official Document Presets
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Equipped with official dimension presets (US 2×2 in, Passport, 3:4 ID Card) and face alignment guides to meet exact requirements for job, college, and visa forms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Our Story & Mission Section -->
    <div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Why We Built Background Changer
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Every day, millions of students, job applicants, and travelers need to update a headshot for a resume, upload an ID photo with a solid white or blue background, or fit a portrait into an exact aspect ratio for an official submission.
        </p>
        <p>
          Existing software is either full of expensive subscription paywalls, forces users to register an account with sensitive personal data, or requires installing massive photo editors that take minutes to open.
        </p>
        <p>
          We created <strong>Background Changer</strong> to solve this permanently. A pure web-standard <strong>photo background editor</strong> that performs instant background segmentation and color replacement locally on your device for free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md shadow-blue-500/20 transition-all"
        >
          <span>Try Background Changer Free</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/how-it-works"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-300 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all"
        >
          <span>How It Works & Guidelines</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
